TEXT -1376 -768 Left 2 !.tran 0 10m 0 50n startup\n.meas tran V12 AVG V(+12V) FROM 9.9m TO 10m\n.meas tran VN12 AVG V(-12V) FROM 9.9m TO 10m\n.meas tran VAUXort AVG V(VAUX) FROM 9.9m TO 10m\n.meas tran Ipk MAX V(CS)/0.11 FROM 9.9m TO 10m\n.meas tran VCSpk MAX V(CS) FROM 9.9m TO 10m\n.meas tran VDSpk MAX V(DRAIN) FROM 9.9m TO 10m\n.meas tran Psn AVG (V(SN)-V(VIN))*(V(SN)-V(VIN))/560 FROM 9m TO 10m\n.meas tran Pin AVG -V(VIN)*I(V1) FROM 9m TO 10m\n.meas tran Pout AVG V(+12V)*V(+12V)/12.6+V(-12V)*V(-12V)/24 FROM 9m TO 10m\n.meas tran Verim PARAM Pout/Pin\n.meas tran Tper TRIG V(GATE) VAL=6 RISE=900 TARG V(GATE) VAL=6 RISE=901\n.meas tran Ton TRIG V(GATE) VAL=6 RISE=900 TARG V(GATE) VAL=6 FALL=900\n.meas tran Fsw PARAM 1/Tper\n.meas tran Duty PARAM Ton/Tper\n.meas tran IQ1 AVG Ic(Q1) FROM 9.9m TO 10m\n.meas tran VCCmin MIN V(VAUX) FROM 6m TO 10m\n.meas tran Tuyan WHEN V(VAUX)=8.4 RISE=1\n.meas tran T12 WHEN V(+12V)=11.5 RISE=1\n.meas tran IQ1max MAX Ic(Q1) FROM 0 TO 10m\n.meas tran PQ1max MAX (V(QC)-V(QE))*Ic(Q1) FROM 0 TO 10m\n.meas tran V12max MAX V(+12V) FROM 0 TO 10m\n.meas tran Ibaslangic MAX V(CS)/0.11 FROM 0 TO 6m\n.meas tran IQ3 AVG Ic(Q3) FROM 9m TO 10m\n.meas tran ILED AVG I(Vled) FROM 6.5m TO 7m\n.meas tran ICT AVG I(Vct) FROM 6.5m TO 7m\n.meas tran CTR PARAM ICT/ILED\n.meas tran Vdip MIN V(+12V) FROM 7m TO 8m\n.meas tran Vpeak MAX V(+12V) FROM 8m TO 9m\n.meas tran IMarsTepe MAX abs(I(R16))\n.meas tran IMarsSon AVG abs(I(R16)) FROM 9m TO 10m\n.meas tran VAUXson AVG V(VAUX) FROM 9m TO 10m\n.meas tran V12son AVG V(+12V) FROM 9m TO 10m\n.meas tran PQ1ort AVG (V(QC)-V(QE))*Ic(Q1) FROM 9m TO 10m\n.meas tran PR16ort AVG I(R16)*I(R16)*470 FROM 9m TO 10m
